From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:07:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/17] router: NAT data plane, LAN services and operator
 config (WAN = wlan0)

Same shape as the LicheeRV router layer, adapted to the board:
- S30eth brings up a WIRED WAN only (eth0 = USB-Ethernet adapter); the
  default WAN is the onboard WiFi (wlan0, owned by S35wifi + dhcpcd), so
  S30eth is a clean no-op in the default configuration
- S60routing unchanged except the WAN fallback default (wlan0)
- dnsmasq/dhcpcd/nftables configs shipped from the series; nftables.conf
  fallback regenerated per-boot by nftgen with the live WAN
- S02resizefs grows the rootfs partition to fill the card on first boot
